#109534:\r\n1. If a new node was created in a fresh StateMachine by shift-dragging out of Start, the editor would print error `INTERNAL ERROR: Index p_transition = -1 is out of bounds (transitions.size() = 0).`\r\n2. When creating a transition by shift-dragging directly out of End or into Start, there was no prevention like what was added for reconnections, so in addition to the error above, we'd also get `INTERNAL ERROR: Condition \"p_from == SceneStringNames::get_singleton()->End || p_to == SceneStringNames::get_singleton()->Start\" is true.` Popups \"Cannot transition from \"End\"! and \"Cannot transition to \"Start\"! have been added here too, to gracefully stop the creation of invalid transitions.\r\n- Additionally, changes popup \"Transition exists!\" to \"Transition already exists!\" to make it a bit clearer, and wraps it in a TTR like the rest.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg